PROCEDURE
1. Firstly you enter your TV settings
2. Within "General Settings", select "Apps"
3. Under "Permissions" is the option: "Security & Restrictions"
4. You will see "Unknown sources", here you will be prompted to allow installation of apps from sources other than the Play Store, ensure this is turned on
5. Now visit your google play store, typically located on the android tv home menu
6. Select "Google Play Store"
7. Perform a search for: Downloader by ADTVnews.com
8. Once downloaded, perform a search for: SmartTube
9. Visit the github page, then navigate to the github.io page
10. Scroll down and locate "Stable release", a download will be performed
11. You will be prompted to allow this to download in the Downloader app, ensure that the Downloader has the correct permissions
12. You will then be prompted to install then open the application

